{
  "id": "grpc-probe-inferred-object-masks",
  "description": "Storage v2 object read and update masks that gcs-mimic decided by inference, on a bucket of its own with a 5-byte object holding the custom metadata key somekey. GetObject read masks, one path per step: a map key (metadata.somekey), a Timestamp member (create_time.seconds), a member of the unset retention (retention.retain_until_time), contexts.custom, a path under a scalar (name.x), a path under a member (owner.entity.x), an empty path, a trailing dot (checksums.) and a leading dot (.name). ReadObject read masks: metadata.no_such_field, metadata.owner.entity without the content, and checksummed_data.content together with object_checksums.crc32c. UpdateObject update_mask, one path per step with a value in the request object: every top-level Object field the pinned proto marks OUTPUT_ONLY other than the recorded create_time and update_time (metageneration, size, delete_time, finalize_time, checksums, update_storage_class_time, owner, component_count, restore_token, soft_delete_time, hard_delete_time), four more fields that the pinned proto does not mark OUTPUT_ONLY (generation, set to the live generation so it still selects the object; etag, set to the current etag so the precondition holds; retention_expire_time; kms_key, naming a key that does not exist), the immutable name and bucket, then storage_class NEARLINE (gcs-mimic refuses it), custom_time, content_encoding and acl (the project owners alone). The * mask over a hold: an object under a temporary hold and another under an event-based hold, each updated with * and a request object that carries only a content type, then read back, to show whether * releases the hold; and * together with content_language on the plain object. The holds are released in always steps so cleanup can delete the objects. Asks RPC-STORAGE-014 get_object_nested_masks, RPC-STORAGE-015 read_object_nested_masks, RPC-STORAGE-017 grpc_update_object_wildcard_mask and its update mask paths, and BEHAVIOR-RPC-002 grpc_masks_nested_paths and grpc_masks_output_only_update_paths (SPEC-GRPC-LOCAL-CHOICES).",
  "bucket": "own",
  "steps": [
    {"name": "write", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/WriteObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": [{"writeObjectSpec": {"resource": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "contentType": "text/plain", "metadata": {"somekey": "v"}}, "objectSize": "5"}, "checksummedData": {"content": "aGVsbG8="}, "finishWrite": true}], "capture": {"gen": "body:resource.generation"}, "compare": false, "expect_status": 0},
    {"name": "get-mask-metadata-key", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": ["metadata.somekey"]}}},
    {"name": "get-mask-timestamp-member", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": ["create_time.seconds"]}}},
    {"name": "get-mask-retention-member", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": ["retention.retain_until_time"]}}},
    {"name": "get-mask-contexts-custom", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": ["contexts.custom"]}}},
    {"name": "get-mask-under-scalar", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": ["name.x"]}}},
    {"name": "get-mask-under-member", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": ["owner.entity.x"]}}},
    {"name": "get-mask-empty-path", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": [""]}}},
    {"name": "get-mask-trailing-dot", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": ["checksums."]}}},
    {"name": "get-mask-leading-dot", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": [".name"]}}},
    {"name": "read-mask-metadata-unknown", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/ReadObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": ["metadata.no_such_field"]}}},
    {"name": "read-mask-metadata-owner-entity", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/ReadObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": ["metadata.owner.entity"]}}},
    {"name": "read-mask-content-and-object-checksums", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/ReadObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": ["checksummed_data.content", "object_checksums.crc32c"]}}},
    {"name": "get-etag", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": ["etag", "metageneration"]}}, "capture": {"etag": "body:etag"}, "expect_status": 0},
    {"name": "update-mask-etag", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "etag": "{etag}"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["etag"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-generation", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "generation": "{gen}"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["generation"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-metageneration", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "metageneration": "7"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["metageneration"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-size", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "size": "99"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["size"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-delete-time", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "deleteTime": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["delete_time"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-finalize-time", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "finalizeTime": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["finalize_time"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-checksums", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "checksums": {"crc32c": 1}}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["checksums"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-update-storage-class-time", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "updateStorageClassTime": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["update_storage_class_time"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-retention-expire-time", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "retentionExpireTime": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["retention_expire_time"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-owner", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "owner": {"entity": "user-gcsmimic-probe"}}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["owner"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-component-count", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "componentCount": 7}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["component_count"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-kms-key", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "kmsKey": "projects/{project}/locations/us-central1/keyRings/gcsmimic-probe/cryptoKeys/missing"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["kms_key"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-restore-token", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "restoreToken": "gcsmimic-probe"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["restore_token"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-soft-delete-time", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "softDeleteTime": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["soft_delete_time"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-hard-delete-time", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "hardDeleteTime": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["hard_delete_time"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-name", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["name"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-bucket", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["bucket"]}}},
    {"name": "get-acl", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}", "readMask": {"paths": ["acl"]}}, "capture": {"pn": "body:acl.0.projectTeam.projectNumber"}, "compare": false, "expect_status": 0},
    {"name": "update-mask-storage-class", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "storageClass": "NEARLINE"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["storage_class"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-custom-time", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "customTime": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["custom_time"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-content-encoding", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "contentEncoding": "gzip"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["content_encoding"]}}},
    {"name": "update-mask-acl", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "acl": [{"entity": "project-owners-{pn}", "role": "OWNER"}]}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["acl"]}}},
    {"name": "write-temporary-hold-object", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/WriteObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": [{"writeObjectSpec": {"resource": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}-temporary", "contentType": "text/plain"}, "objectSize": "1"}, "checksummedData": {"content": "eA=="}, "finishWrite": true}], "compare": false, "expect_status": 0},
    {"name": "write-event-hold-object", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/WriteObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": [{"writeObjectSpec": {"resource": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}-event", "contentType": "text/plain"}, "objectSize": "1"}, "checksummedData": {"content": "eA=="}, "finishWrite": true}], "compare": false, "expect_status": 0},
    {"name": "set-temporary-hold", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}-temporary", "temporaryHold": true}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["temporary_hold"]}}, "compare": false},
    {"name": "update-wildcard-over-temporary-hold", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}-temporary", "contentType": "text/x-wildcard"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["*"]}}},
    {"name": "get-after-wildcard-over-temporary-hold", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}-temporary", "readMask": {"paths": ["content_type", "temporary_hold", "event_based_hold", "metageneration"]}}},
    {"name": "set-event-based-hold", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}-event", "eventBasedHold": true}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["event_based_hold"]}}, "compare": false},
    {"name": "update-wildcard-over-event-based-hold", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}-event", "contentType": "text/x-wildcard"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["*"]}}},
    {"name": "get-after-wildcard-over-event-based-hold", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/GetObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "object": "{object}-event", "readMask": {"paths": ["content_type", "temporary_hold", "event_based_hold", "metageneration"]}}},
    {"name": "update-wildcard-and-another-path", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}", "contentType": "text/plain", "contentLanguage": "fr"}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["*", "content_language"]}}},
    {"name": "release-temporary-hold", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}-temporary", "temporaryHold": false}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["temporary_hold"]}}, "compare": false, "always": true},
    {"name": "release-event-based-hold", "protocol": "grpc", "rpc": "google.storage.v2.Storage/UpdateObject", "headers": {"x-goog-request-params": "bucket=projects%2F_%2Fbuckets%2F{bucket}"}, "body": {"object": {"bucket": "projects/_/buckets/{bucket}", "name": "{object}-event", "eventBasedHold": false}, "updateMask": {"paths": ["event_based_hold"]}}, "compare": false, "always": true}
  ]
}
